WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.667
-It's time for "Good Name,
Bad Name, Great Name."

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.934
Here we go, everyone.
-♪ Good name ♪

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:08.167
♪ Bad name
great name ♪

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.868
-First off, we have "Nope."

00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:13.367
Well, that is a good name
for a horror movie.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.534
That is a bad name
for a dating app.

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:18.367
It's a great name for what
McDonald's employees say

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:21.200
every time you ask if the
McFlurry machine is working.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.167
[ Cheers and applause ]
Nope.

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:26.801
Next, we have "Break my soul."

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.300
That's a good name
for a Beyoncé song.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.834
It's a bad name for a show
store.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:34.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.767
It's a great name for
being on hold

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:37.601
with Spectrum cable
customer service.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:42.300
[ Applause ]
Argh! Forget it!

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.400
After that there's
"the gray man."

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.200
That's a good name
for a Netflix movie.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.267
It's a bad name for a superhero.

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:50.634
A great name for a retired
member of the Blue Man Group.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:54.033
[ Laughter, applause ]
He used to be --

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:57.667
Next up, there's
"rolling loud."

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.667
Well, that's a good name for a
music festival.

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.133
It's a bad name for a nursing
home shuttle.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:05.100
And a great name for getting
the grocery cart

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.667
with the squeaky wheel.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.467
It's like, ah, ah. Sorry
everybody, it's gonna be loud.

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:10.934
[ Applause ]

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.434
And finally, there's
"about damn time."

00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:15.367
That's a good name
for a Lizzo song.

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:18.067
It's a bad name
for a food delivery app.

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.434
[ Laughter ]
It's a great name for

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:22.133
a documentary about clocks
voiced by Samuel L. Jackson.

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.434 --> 00:01:25.000
That is all for "Good Name,
Bad Name, Great Name."

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.133
We have a great show tonight.

